{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe long spell of fair weather has finally broken. The air feels different tonight, a bit heavier, as if the city is settling in for a proper autumn. The Kleins departed this morning. Our time together was brief and largely confined to our meals; we did little sightseeing, which I confess I found rather convenient. I prefer the company of good food and conversation to wandering the streets in the heat, though I suspect you would have enjoyed the promenades.\n\nI intend to stay a few more days. There are places I have not yet visited, and now that the oppressive heat has lifted, I feel I can actually walk again without feeling like a boiled egg. I shall take my time, perhaps visit the museum properly, and enjoy a quiet evening with a glass of wine and a good book. Do not worry. I am comfortable, and the change in weather feels like a relief.\n\nYours affectionately,\n\nG."}}],"created":1795080372,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":196,"prompt_tokens":920,"total_tokens":1116,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-pVCHwc1lMtldmJc8Jq1O9YRwW5XsuB4u","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":920,"prompt_ms":915.687,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9953119565217391,"prompt_per_second":1004.710124747867,"predicted_n":196,"predicted_ms":4646.388,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.82763076923077,"predicted_per_second":41.96808359525722}}